# Build artifact — regenerated from variation-fee-calculator/ via the zip script
variation-fee-calculator.zip

# Source documents the generators read (not part of the tool itself) -- the fee-calculator
# workbook, the CMDh Q&A PDF (extract_qa.py), the Art. 5 tracking table .xls (extract_art5.py).
# The scripts carry the download URLs; the data files they produce are committed, the sources
# are not.
*.xlsx
# ...except the fee workbook itself. It stopped being a mere source document the
# moment the toolbox stopped shipping it: it is the reference implementation of
# every fee rule, and the only place the formula semantics can be read back
# (a cap, for instance, lives in a row's Sf column, not where you first look).
# 216 KB is a small price for keeping that readable after the tool drops it.
!Variation-Fee-Calculator-EU.xlsx
~$*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pdf

# Other non-project files in this folder
*.docx

# Python byte-code caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# OS/editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Brainstorming visual-companion scratch
.superpowers/
